+// E7 the siege (LOSSES_P15 §10): a gem group no team size finishes in one go (a monolith, 00stampede's 20-camp block,
+// 02the-pack's 48-camp one) is never priced, so maps whose gems sit in such groups go 0-0 (00stampede alone: 0 gems in
